{"path":"thread/sleep_until","title":"std::this_thread::sleep_until","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::this_thread::</span>sleep_until","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/thread/sleep_until","section":"thread","kind":"page","summary":"Blocks the execution of the current thread until specified sleep_time has been reached.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc-header\">\n<td> <div>Defined in header <code><a href=\"/w/cpp/header/thread\">&lt;thread&gt;</a></code>\n </div></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx11\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">template</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span> <span class=\"kw1\">class</span> Clock, <span class=\"kw1\">class</span> Duration <span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><br><span class=\"kw4\">void</span> sleep_until<span class=\"br0\">(</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/chrono/time_point\"><span class=\"kw995\">std::<span class=\"me2\">chrono</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">time_point</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>Clock, Duration<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> sleep_time <span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(since C++11)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Blocks the execution of the current thread until specified <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">sleep_time</span></code> has been reached. \n</p><p><code>Clock</code> must meet the <a href=\"/w/cpp/named_req/Clock\"><em class=\"t-named-req\">Clock</em></a> requirements.<span class=\"t-rev-inl t-since-cxx20\"><span> The program is ill-formed if <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/chrono/is_clock\"><span class=\"kw2568\">std::<span class=\"me2\">chrono</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">is_clock_v</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>Clock<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span></span></code> is <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw2\">false</span></span></code>.</span><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx20\">(since C++20)</span></span></span>\n</p><p>The standard recommends that the clock tied to <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">sleep_time</span></code> be used, in which case adjustments of the clock may be taken into account. Thus, the duration of the block might be more or less than <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">sleep_time <span class=\"sy2\">-</span> Clock<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">now</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code> at the time of the call, depending on the direction of the adjustment and whether it is honored by the implementation. The function also may block until after <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">sleep_time</span></code> has been reached due to process scheduling or resource contention delays.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"t-par-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> sleep_time\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> time to block until\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p>(none)\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Exceptions\">Exceptions</h3>\n<p>Any exception thrown by <code>Clock</code> or <code>Duration</code> (clocks and durations provided by the standard library never throw).\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-example\">\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;chrono&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;thread&gt;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">auto</span> now<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"br0\">{</span> <span class=\"kw1\">return</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/chrono/steady_clock/now\"><span class=\"kw2690\">std::<span class=\"me2\">chrono</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">steady_clock</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">now</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span> <span class=\"br0\">}</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">auto</span> awake_time<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"kw1\">using</span> std<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">chrono</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">operator</span><span class=\"st0\">\"\"</span>ms<span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"kw1\">return</span> now<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy2\">+</span> 2000ms<span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">int</span> main<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"Hello, waiter...<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>\"</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/manip/flush\"><span class=\"kw1807\">std::<span class=\"me2\">flush</span></span></a><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> <span class=\"kw4\">auto</span> start<span class=\"br0\">{</span>now<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">}</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    std<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">this_thread</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">sleep_until</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>awake_time<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/chrono/duration\"><span class=\"kw997\">std::<span class=\"me2\">chrono</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">duration</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kw4\">double</span>, <a href=\"/w/cpp/numeric/ratio/ratio\"><span class=\"kw1539\">std::<span class=\"me2\">milli</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span> elapsed<span class=\"br0\">{</span>now<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy2\">-</span> start<span class=\"br0\">}</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"Waited \"</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> elapsed.<span class=\"me1\">count</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\" ms<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>\"</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n<p>Possible output:\n</p>\n<pre data-output=\"1\"><code>Hello, waiter...\nWaited 2000.17 ms</code></pre> \n</div>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/thread/sleep_for\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>sleep_for</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(C++11)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  stops the execution of the current thread for a specified time duration <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td colspan=\"2\"> <div class=\"t-dsc-see\"><span><a href=\"/w/c/thread/thrd_sleep\">C documentation</a></span> for <span class=\"t-dsc-see-tt\"><span>thrd_sleep</span></span></div>\n</td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"Exceptions","id":"Exceptions"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"thread","title":"Concurrency support library (since C++11)"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::this_thread::sleep_until","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"1 declaration; revisions: since C++11. Blocks the execution of the current thread until specified sleep_time has been reached."},{"label":"Parameters","note":"sleep_time"},{"label":"Return value","note":"(none)"},{"label":"Exceptions","note":"Any exception thrown by Clock or Duration (clocks and durations provided by the standard library never throw)."},{"label":"Example"},{"label":"See also","children":[{"label":"sleep_for","note":"stops the execution of the current thread for a specified time duration"}]}]},"standards":["C++11","C++20"],"wordCount":230,"codeBlockCount":2}
